    {
      "id": "03-fats",
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "fats",
      "text": "0.1 grams of fat. Cholesterol is 0 milligrams and saturated fat is only 0.01 grams, so there is almost no saturated-fat baggage. Polyunsaturated fat is just 0.04 grams and omega 3 is only 1 milligram, so there is no useful fat story either. In the misc category, being nearly fat-free does not rescue the rest of the food.",
