    {
      "id": "04-carbs",
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "carbs",
      "text": "27.4 grams of carbs. Sugar is 21.3 grams, while fibre is only 0.3 grams, so very little slows the carbohydrate down. The glycemic index is 55, although a normal spoonful keeps the real glycemic load smaller than the 100-gram sheet suggests. For a sweet condiment, this is still a weak carb profile.",
