    {
      "id": "05-proteins",
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "proteins",
      "text": "1 gram of protein. Essential amino acids score 0 out of 9 because none reaches a useful amount at this food quantity. Protein digestibility is 78%, but that percentage only describes how digestible the tiny amount is. It does not turn ketchup into a protein food. In this category, the protein section barely matters.",
      "textSha256": "bbaec938814ce9700516f4b0f14d8756658ac31283fde67fff11fc0e1bccb9c3",
      "characterCount": 317,
      "byteLength": 258342,
